  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference implementation for federated privacy-preserving analysis in European epidemiological and clinical research — over a decade of production use with real-world consented data. Enables simultaneous multi-site analysis without any individual-level data leaving each institution. Automated statistical disclosure control prevents re-identification. dsBase (server-side) ships with 12,000+ validation tests. Governed by an advisory board and steering committee at the University of Liverpool. GPL-3.0. Deployed across major EU research networks (EUCAN-Connect, SYNCHROS) via OBiBa Opal nodes. Adopt for any team requiring federated analysis across distributed sensitive health datasets without data pooling.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-06-02",
